/**
 * @mainpage Introduction
 ChibiOS - Copyright (C) 2006-2026 Giovanni Di Sirio.
 *
 * <h2>Features</h2>
 * - Isolated sandboxes on MPU-equipped ARM Cortex-M devices, each with its
 *   own memory regions.
 * - Sandboxes interact with the host only through fastcalls, syscalls,
 *   virtual IRQs and virtual I/O drivers.
 * - POSIX-like services for sandbox applications, including files over the
 *   VFS.
 * - Sandbox images loaded from ELF files.
 * - Sandbox applications can be bare-metal or run a guest kernel: ChibiOS/RT,
 *   ChibiOS/NIL, FreeRTOS, ThreadX or Zephyr.
 * .
 * <h2>Related pages</h2>
 * - @subpage concepts
 * .
 */
